=> the test body lives in custom_styling.rs, which mod.rs compiles only under
   `#[cfg(feature = "custom_styling")]`, while the test itself is
   `#[cfg(not(feature = "custom_styling"))]` — a contradiction, so it is compiled out
   in BOTH feature configurations and has never run. Its input is also malformed:
   the closing sequence is `ESC ] 8 ; ; ESC` with no final backslash, so it is not
   what a well-formed emitter produces.

